[{"doc_id": "doc_0ac6", "sent_idx": 17, "cleaned_version": 1, "sentence": "The bundle must already exist on the requested path on the execution node."}, {"doc_id": "doc_0ac6", "sent_idx": 82, "cleaned_version": 1, "sentence": "Commands run with the --container flag are resolved through PATH before they are sent to the container. If the container has a unique file structure, it may be necessary to give the full path to the command or specify --export=NONE to have the container define the PATH to be used:
